        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2182"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts458" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts484">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I was there also like, doing you know those sounds, "Lame, when are we finishing it already?"</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
