        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2164"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts486" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts492">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Some people were angry with me because of it, like, don't show your rudeness here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2185"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts496" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts510">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I just wanted to piss them off, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2210"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts512" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts545">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And was sitting like that there, making those claims. Then the girls in front of me turned around and said, "Could you not be so loud, we cannot hear the movie." Really?? They were really watching it, holy shit.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
