        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2343"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts848" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts856">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, I also like those scary things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a715"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts858" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts881">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think in class 8 or 9 I once had an olympiad organized by fund Daryn. So, the olympiad was over, we had lunch, and then there was that "performance" about the drugs. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a720"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts884" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts894">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>About the drugs.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a722"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts896" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts917">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we were given some sheets of paper to write all the drug names we know. Me, a passionate Shameless enjoyer since grade 8, I wrote like a list of 15 drugs or something.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a724"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts920" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts927">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oxytocin, vike,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a725"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts930" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts951">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, yes. Also like heroin, synthetical crystals, methadone, you know, according to the list.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a727"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts958" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts963">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Opium, non-opium.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a728"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts966" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts991">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes yes yes. Also, the others around didn't seem to know any drug whatsoever. I was like, hey dude, write something, not just simple marijuana.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a732"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts994" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1007">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Try to write something like methadone or cocaine, you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
