        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2097"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts292" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts304">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, firsly they made classes 45 minutes, not 90. Like the first class - 20 minutes, then a 5-minute break, then another 20-minute class.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2098"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts306" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts330">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, the classes were shortened and everyone would finish at the same time, like at 1PM. So, at one 9AM class named KMW, our curator...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a2099"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts332" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts342">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>...called the overslept students' mothers to send them to the classes.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
