                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts612" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts630">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yes, it is a very popular phenomenon here. Whenever you open any book, whether you are in your first year at uni or in class 1 at school, you will see his face in any book and just feel proud you know.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
